    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, but it just feels like a lie. like a script people read when they dont know what else to say. in reality, i just see the exhaustion in their eyes every time i talk about my problems. it would just be more peaceful for everyone if i didn't have to keep putting them through it. like, at what point does \"trying\" just become more selfishness?",
